    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Elliott",
      "key": "summer_Tue6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I write in hopes of connecting with others through time and space.$u#$e#*sigh*...times are changing, though. People don't read anymore.$s",
      "translation": "Píšu v naději, že se skrze čas a prostor spojím s ostatními.$u#$e#*povzdech*... Časy se však mění. Lidé už nečtou.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "be588786f5ad4d5ee3314af54701bb7a0a27c88dbeba16c8c03679a68c4b11be",
      "translationSHA256": "e9b601e5907d40c319ef056c9ee1dae0a3534208f4b789422fa496713b099ce0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
